    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solace Inc. is back and ready to kick some ass! Join the crew, grab some weapons, and travel across spacetime to fight some baddies... or fight each other?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solace Inc. 2 is an expansion of the first game's universe in a brand new dimension, with new worlds and foes as well as familiar places and faces. Play as a wide variety of unique characters with an expansive arsenal of weapons, and fight against a variety of foes ranging from alien insects, to rogue robots, to screaming demons, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ playable characters with unique special abilities and attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unlockable and craftable weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of worlds to explore and fight in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming dialogue from a vast cast of characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging foes and bosses who don't like you very much</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and more! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're still hiring, submit your application to Solace Inc. today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solace Inc. is back and ready to kick some ass! Join the crew, grab some weapons, and travel across spacetime to fight some baddies... or fight each other?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solace Inc. 2 is an expansion of the first game's universe in a brand new dimension, with new worlds and foes as well as familiar places and faces. Play as a wide variety of unique characters with an expansive arsenal of weapons, and fight against a variety of foes ranging from alien insects, to rogue robots, to screaming demons, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ playable characters with unique special abilities and attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unlockable and craftable weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of worlds to explore and fight in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming dialogue from a vast cast of characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging foes and bosses who don't like you very much</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and more! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're still hiring, submit your application to Solace Inc. today!</p>",
